* Open ready-to-analyse.sav first.
FILTER OFF.
USE ALL.
WEIGHT OFF.
SPLIT FILE OFF.
EXECUTE.

* CHECKING FOR NORMALITY.
EXAMINE VARIABLES=sodium chol_change /PLOT HISTOGRAM NPPLOT /STATISTICS DESCRIPTIVES /MISSING LISTWISE.
EXAMINE VARIABLES=chol_before BY female /PLOT HISTOGRAM NPPLOT /STATISTICS DESCRIPTIVES /NOTOTAL.

* INDEPENDENT-SAMPLES T-TESTS: GROUP 1 MALE, GROUP 2 FEMALE.
T-TEST GROUPS=female(0 1) /VARIABLES=sodium chol_before /CRITERIA=CI(.95).

* PAIRED T-TEST: BEFORE MINUS AFTER.
T-TEST PAIRS=chol_before WITH chol_after (PAIRED) /CRITERIA=CI(.95).
* EXERCISE: REVERSE THE SUBTRACTION.
T-TEST PAIRS=chol_after WITH chol_before (PAIRED) /CRITERIA=CI(.95).

* MEDIANS TO ACCOMPANY THE NONPARAMETRIC COMPARISONS.
EXAMINE VARIABLES=chol_after BY female /PLOT NONE /STATISTICS DESCRIPTIVES /NOTOTAL.
EXAMINE VARIABLES=chol_after BY diabetes_yes /PLOT NONE /STATISTICS DESCRIPTIVES /NOTOTAL.
EXAMINE VARIABLES=chol_before chol_after BY smoking_code /PLOT NONE /STATISTICS DESCRIPTIVES /NOTOTAL.
